desc="Fan curves, LEDs, display brightness, battery charge limits and beeper of the UnifyDrive UP6 / ZSpace T6. Requires T6 Drivers."
changelog="1.2.1: the dashboard health check no longer reports the optional front panel (t6-paneld, t6-panel-kiosk) as a fault when it is stopped or not installed. 1.2.0: Wi-Fi and Bluetooth LEDs have three modes (all states, alerts only, off) and faults show red in every mode; a hotspot heartbeat switch; a saved Wi-Fi network out of range no longer lights yellow; the tray light gets its own card with colour swatches; the per-LED Advanced section and the "always off after boot" display option are gone (the screen always comes up on, systemd-backlight restores the level, and levels down to 1 % are allowed). 1.0.3: screen off now only switches the panel display off instead of putting it to sleep, which could leave the touchscreen reporting phantom touches and made double-tap wake impossible. 1.0.2: coordinated panel sleep/wake with safe backlight ordering; serialized display controls; IT6616 driver health reporting and safer driver upgrades."

